          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "государство (gosudárstvo) — \"the state, a country\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Государство помогает пенсионерам. Gosudárstvo pomogáyet pensionéram. The state helps pensioners."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. Государственный — state, public: государственный язык."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "государство (gosudárstvo) is built on государь \"a sovereign\", which is usually traced to older господарь \"a lord, a master\", from господь \"lord\"."
            }
          ]
        },
